\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's the thing. The Siwannes never got further than a general pantheon roster and a PSP (Karpi, channeling Virtue Extremities into more practical applications, though still equally destructive). No cosmology chapter, and no antagonists - Titan or otherwise.</div> </div> </div> </div>ah ok. that still sounds cool, but i really like the titans. <br /> <br /> well, now i know i havent missed anything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26173-evtrax","name":"evtrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-01T07:06:04-08:00","id":1426822,"title":"","content":"but if anyone has the 1st ed siwannes, i wouldnt say no to having it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26173-evtrax","name":"evtrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}